       vice number identifying a device containing a mounted filesystem.  _u_b_u_f
       is a pointer to a _u_s_t_a_t structure that contains the following members:

           daddr_t f_tfree;      /* Total free blocks */
           ino_t   f_tinode;     /* Number of free inodes */
